                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is a fun project for someone trying Unity for the first time, but no one should pay money for this. Where do I start?\n\nOne snowman model, isn't animated, doesn't make any noise except a POOF when it dies.\nYou can unlock any weapon you want after wave 2, and then you don't need any more weapons. \nMachine gun trigger is a toggle on/off fire mode. Really weird.\nNo real change in gameplay after wave 1. It's just minutely faster, with more of the same snowmen.\nAlso your guns don't have ammo, and you never need to reload. \n\nStuff like this is why Steam is so cluttered. Valve REALLY needs to work on quality control.",
